energies=[
 ('EN-01','Vehicle motion / gravity','Train can roll, separate or shift even with0%target; suspension/body/lift loads can fall.','Accepted independent rail-vehicle restraint, track protection and engineered lift/support points; task-specific stability.','Brake command or estimated grade is not independent blocking.'),
 ('EN-02','Spring brake stored force','Combination chamber spring remains hazardous without air.','Exact delivered OEM qualified service/replacement and independently restrained rescue method if required.','Do not open spring chamber or infer safe force from zero gauge pressure.'),
 ('EN-03','Air reservoirs / isolated lines','Check valves/closed cocks can trap pressure or allow reaccumulation.','Actual tagged circuit/isolation/verification and pressure-vessel/brake protection basis.','No universal drain/vent sequence or assumed single-gauge isolation.'),
 ('EN-04','Suspension / sidebearer / loaded mechanism','Loaded coils, bump stops, sidebearers, stairs/lifts and body supports can store force or move.','Actual unloading/restraint/support method for selected geometry and task.','Do not remove a mount, guide, torque link or stop under uncharacterized load.'),
 ('EN-05','Electrical AC/DC / shore / battery','Multiple sources, charger/generator backfeed and stored electrical energy.','Electrical specialist establishes disconnect/absence-of-energy, discharge, grounding/bonding and test precautions.','Software off, disconnected low-voltage control or E-stop is not all-source isolation.'),
 ('EN-06','Diesel start, fuel and hot exhaust','Unexpected start, fuel/fire/chemical exposure, hot cooling/exhaust/DPF.','Exact engine shutdown/start isolation/cooldown/fuel/fire and exhaust service methods.','No homemade fuel/exhaust/DPF bypass or occupied-cabin exposure assumption.'),
 ('EN-07','Hydrostatic propulsion pressure and rotating drive','Closed-loop/charge pressure, accumulator if actually fitted, inertia and mechanically coupled axles.','Actual OEM drive circuit and supported shaft/gear energy isolation; restrained rotating hardware.','Hydraulic propulsion is not the superseded hydraulic coach-brake system.'),
 ('EN-08','Test fixture / applied loads','Ballast, actuators, restrained springs/pressure and lifted equipment store energy.','Approved guarded fixture/load path/containment, calibrated instruments, abort/rescue plan and qualified director.','No test from a crosswalk or blank result sheet alone.')]
